WEBVTT

NOTE Visual text from a silent video.

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.400
Retrieval, validation and storage can follow a known path.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:14.100
Data moves through those stages without the model choosing the sequence.

3
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:22.000
A complex flow does not become an agent merely by being complex.

4
00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:29.400
The copilot prepares a message and shows who would receive it.

5
00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:36.100
The draft waits for approval of that specific action.

6
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:44.000
The person retains control of the consequential external step.

7
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:51.400
Ask when the customer is missing; query invoices once the customer is identified.

8
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:58.100
The objective stays fixed even when the next tool changes.

9
00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:06.000
Policy limits the options available at each decision.

10
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:13.400
The model produces a proposed call with a name and arguments.

11
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:20.100
The runtime validates the contract and authority before calling the API.

12
00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:28.000
It then returns the actual result to the decision context.

13
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:35.400
A support agent can read orders for the authorized customer.

14
00:01:35.400 --> 00:01:42.100
That does not let it delete records or grant itself write access.

15
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:50.000
Express autonomy as resources and actions, not as a label.

16
00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:57.400
The objective asks for a saved draft, not a sent message.

17
00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:04.100
The tool result identifies draft D4 and its state.

18
00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:12.000
Check that evidence and stop without taking extra actions.
